# Soldier (R3, the friendly Army): rounded helmet with a steady blue-white lamp (its light cue), olive fatigues,
# back pack, rifle across the chest. Friendly shapes are rounded (art bible); never signal yellow.
name soldier
grid 5
size 16 14 36
slot body Olive
slot dark Ink
slot lamp AllyBlue
slot steel Steel
box 6 3 0 9 6 14 body
box 6 8 0 9 11 14 body
box 4 2 0 9 6 1 dark
box 4 8 0 9 12 1 dark
box 5 3 14 11 11 27 body
box 3 4 17 5 10 26 dark
box 6 5 27 11 9 31 dark
ellipsoid 8 7 32 3.4 3 2.2 body
box 11 4 30 13 10 32 lamp
# Cue band round the chest, readable from every side (lineup2).
box 4 2 22 12 12 23 lamp
beam 7 2 24 15 5 25 1.0 steel
pivot 8 7 0
# R20 animation segments: legs from the hip, the rifle across the chest (ArmR) from the grip, head from the neck.
part LegL 0 0 0 16 7 14 7.5 4.5 14
part LegR 0 7 0 16 14 14 7.5 9.5 14
part ArmR 11 0 22 16 7 27 11 3 24
part Head 0 0 27 16 14 36 8 7 27
